{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/bc92328eda0e6a5f65b168bf7e995bfc.poster.avif?t=1768918945\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/bc92328eda0e6a5f65b168bf7e995bfc.webm?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/bc92328eda0e6a5f65b168bf7e995bfc.mp4?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Goblin Gate has opened once more, and great profits await you, should you be strong enough to slay the monsters and drain their valuable green blood.</i><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fortify your tower, brew your homunculi, and prepare for a bloody adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>FLASK</i> combines <strong>deckbuilding strategy</strong> with <strong>autobattle combat</strong> in a post-medieval dark fantasy world. You are a debt-ridden alchemist, braving the goblin wastes in your leased mobile tower. Command your homunculus heroes in battle against hideous fiends, harvest their blood, and get rich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a team:</strong>\u00a0Each run begins with one homunculus but ends with a team of three.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied heroes:</strong> Each homunculus has their own set of unique flasks, with over 500 flasks in the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creativity pays:</strong>\u00a0Every hero supports many different builds. Will your Warrior be a tank, berserker, duelist, or something in between? </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/a453da642815fa8474eaa0eac181b5dc.avif?t=1768918945\" width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/487b5fe80a3960a5c60d2a6bf4b074ee.poster.avif?t=1768918945\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/487b5fe80a3960a5c60d2a6bf4b074ee.webm?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/487b5fe80a3960a5c60d2a6bf4b074ee.mp4?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark frontier, <strong>monsters\u2019 green blood</strong> is as good as liquid gold. Slash, stab, and smash your way through an endless horde of mutated, rotting creatures as you grow strong enough to <strong>battle rival alchemists</strong> and establish your dominance on the road!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/a838f0b7b4de7f56c9bb57fcdb213a6b.avif?t=1768918945\" width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/d6805dc449d5265e09ad7849309aae1c.poster.avif?t=1768918945\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/d6805dc449d5265e09ad7849309aae1c.webm?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/d6805dc449d5265e09ad7849309aae1c.mp4?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has their own unique  strategies, but what matters most is how you combine them to <strong>create a strong team</strong>. In addition to flasks, your heroes can gain <strong>items</strong>, <strong>snacks</strong>, and <strong>mutations</strong> to grow increasingly powerful. Each flask has <strong>two elements</strong>. Equipping at least three flasks of any element unlocks powerful team-wide effects that change how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/7d9a21c1ce83c851b54ec04cef406e2b.avif?t=1768918945\" width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/8eb7a0a0a26a174a35631d8ec389483e.poster.avif?t=1768918945\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/8eb7a0a0a26a174a35631d8ec389483e.webm?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/8eb7a0a0a26a174a35631d8ec389483e.mp4?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face rival alchemists in <strong>asynchronous multiplayer combat</strong>. Every third map, an enemy player appears, ready to challenge you with their own homunculi! Survive, and you\u2019ll earn the chance to either mutate one of your heroes for a powerful effect or <strong>recruit the enemy homunculus to your team</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/65c991b85c5746ea0168891beb283838.avif?t=1768918945\" width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/b8833f25de2b83a486f972f2941a35c7.poster.avif?t=1768918945\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/b8833f25de2b83a486f972f2941a35c7.webm?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/b8833f25de2b83a486f972f2941a35c7.mp4?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run through the Goblin Gate promises  great riches and harrowing discoveries. <strong>Gruesome monsters, greedy merchants, and powerful allies</strong> await those bold enough to venture deeper. But beware - delve too far, and you may uncover the origins of these creatures\u2026 <strong>and the truth behind the gate itself.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714280?t=1768918945","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714280?t=1768918945","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/c7d31340cde6aea12371949c8207d6925cc989df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768918945","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/c7d31340cde6aea12371949c8207d6925cc989df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768918945","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game is very bloody and violent, but it is all cartoon/fantasy violence and very over-the-top in an often comedic way."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/bc92328eda0e6a5f65b168bf7e995bfc.poster.avif?t=1768918945\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/bc92328eda0e6a5f65b168bf7e995bfc.webm?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/bc92328eda0e6a5f65b168bf7e995bfc.mp4?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Goblin Gate has opened once more, and great profits await you, should you be strong enough to slay the monsters and drain their valuable green blood.</i><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fortify your tower, brew your homunculi, and prepare for a bloody adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>FLASK</i> combines <strong>deckbuilding strategy</strong> with <strong>autobattle combat</strong> in a post-medieval dark fantasy world. You are a debt-ridden alchemist, braving the goblin wastes in your leased mobile tower. Command your homunculus heroes in battle against hideous fiends, harvest their blood, and get rich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a team:</strong>\u00a0Each run begins with one homunculus but ends with a team of three.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied heroes:</strong> Each homunculus has their own set of unique flasks, with over 500 flasks in the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creativity pays:</strong>\u00a0Every hero supports many different builds. Will your Warrior be a tank, berserker, duelist, or something in between? </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/a453da642815fa8474eaa0eac181b5dc.avif?t=1768918945\" width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/487b5fe80a3960a5c60d2a6bf4b074ee.poster.avif?t=1768918945\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/487b5fe80a3960a5c60d2a6bf4b074ee.webm?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/487b5fe80a3960a5c60d2a6bf4b074ee.mp4?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark frontier, <strong>monsters\u2019 green blood</strong> is as good as liquid gold. Slash, stab, and smash your way through an endless horde of mutated, rotting creatures as you grow strong enough to <strong>battle rival alchemists</strong> and establish your dominance on the road!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/a838f0b7b4de7f56c9bb57fcdb213a6b.avif?t=1768918945\" width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3