ou with their own homunculi! Survive, and you\u2019ll earn the chance to either mutate one of your heroes for a powerful effect or <strong>recruit the enemy homunculus to your team</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/65c991b85c5746ea0168891beb283838.avif?t=1768918945\" width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/b8833f25de2b83a486f972f2941a35c7.poster.avif?t=1768918945\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/b8833f25de2b83a486f972f2941a35c7.webm?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/extras/b8833f25de2b83a486f972f2941a35c7.mp4?t=1768918945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run through the Goblin Gate promises  great riches and harrowing discoveries. <strong>Gruesome monsters, greedy merchants, and powerful allies</strong> await those bold enough to venture deeper. But beware - delve too far, and you may uncover the origins of these creatures\u2026 <strong>and the truth behind the gate itself.</strong></p>","developers":["Chop Chop Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714280/15373cc143f9bb434d105d671da0090f871c7cba/header.jpg?t=1768918945","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><